      },
      "text": "CONSTITUTIONAL FOUNDATION:\n  1st Amendment:  speech, press, religion, assembly, petition\n  4th Amendment:  unreasonable searches and seizures\n  5th Amendment:  due process; self-incrimination\n  6th Amendment:  speedy trial; counsel; jury\n  8th Amendment:  cruel and unusual punishment\n  14th Amendment: equal protection; due process (applied to states)"
    },
